ic computer, Chromebook, or any device without the app installed, you can access your iCloud control dashboard by visiting **[iCloud.com](https://www.icloud.com/)**. From there, you can view your Photos, Mail, Notes, Drive, Reminders, and locate lost devices using \"Find My.\"",
